# Alzheimer’s Signal source import file (pipe-delimited)
#
# This file contains Alzheimer’s RSS/Atom sources whose publisher permission
# or reuse licence was not clearly verified in the condition pack review.
# They are intentionally disabled by default. Import only after reviewing the
# current publisher terms and accepting responsibility for use.
#
# To add or review a source, find the publisher’s official RSS or Atom URL,
# confirm that it returns RSS/Atom XML (not ordinary HTML), then read the
# linked Terms, RSS policy, copyright notice, and reuse/licensing information.
# Record the exact terms URL and any rights or corrections contact. If no
# RSS-specific permission is stated, use the conservative values in this file:
# headline, date, attribution and outbound link only. Permission and commercial
# use are not verified.
#
# Comments start with #. The first non-comment line is the schema. Each later
# non-comment line is one source. Blank lines are ignored. Categories must be
# News, Research or Community. Google rows are intermediary feeds and remain
# disabled unless authorization is obtained.
#
# Fields are pipe-delimited. Do not place an unescaped pipe in a value.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
